  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Alien Base is a decentralized exchange on Base offering aggregated liquidity and token trading, including V2-style AMM pools, V3-style concentrated liquidity, limit orders, yield farming/staking, and support for token and memecoin trading. StableSwap is one component of the broader exchange rather than the primary current product. The protocol also includes the native ALB token and related distribution and escrow mechanisms.",
